
Raden Todo TUI
----------------
commands:
  help   show this help
  list   show pending and done tasks
  add    add a new pending task
  done   move a pending task to done by exact title
  undo   move a done task back to pending by exact title
  clear  remove all done tasks
  quit   exit the app

cmd> new task> added task.

cmd> new task> added task.

cmd> 
pending tasks
  1. buy milk
  2. write code

done tasks
  (empty)

cmd> done task title> marked done.

cmd> 
pending tasks
  1. write code

done tasks
  1. buy milk

cmd> undo task title> moved back to pending.

cmd> cleared done tasks.

cmd> 
pending tasks
  1. write code
  2. buy milk

done tasks
  (empty)

cmd> 
bye.
